<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:TPM="http://texlive.dante.de/"><rdf:Description about="http://www.miktex.org/packages/ctex"><TPM:Name>CTeX</TPM:Name><TPM:Creator>mpc</TPM:Creator><TPM:Title>LaTeX classes and packages for Chinese typesetting</TPM:Title><TPM:Version>2.6.5</TPM:Version><TPM:TargetSystem minVersion=""></TPM:TargetSystem><TPM:Description>ctex is a bundle of LaTeX classes and packages for typesetting documents in Chinese. It works with the (pdf)LaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX engines, supports GB2312 / UTF-8 / Unicode input, integrates Chinese punctuation kerning, multi-engine font configuration, and provides Chinese-style section heading commands for the standard article / book / report classes.</TPM:Description><TPM:RunFiles size="1719504">texmf\tex\generic\ctex\ctex-spa-make.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\ctex-spa-macro.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\zhmap\ctex-zhmap-adobe.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\zhmap\ctex-zhmap-mac.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\zhmap\ctex-zhmap-fandol.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\zhmap\ctex-zhmap-windows.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\zhmap\ctex-zhmap-hanyi.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\zhmap\ctex-zhmap-ubuntu.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\zhmap\ctex-zhmap-founder.tex texmf\tex\generic\ctex\ctxdocstrip.tex texmf\tex\luatex\ctex\ctex-zhconv.lua texmf\tex\luatex\ctex\ctex-zhconv-index.lua texmf\tex\latex\ctex\ctex-c5size.clo texmf\tex\latex\ctex\ctex-cs4size.clo texmf\tex\latex\ctex\ctexspa.def texmf\tex\latex\ctex\config\ctex-name-gbk.cfg texmf\tex\latex\ctex\config\ctexopts.cfg texmf\tex\latex\ctex\config\ctex.cfg texmf\tex\latex\ctex\config\ctex-name-utf8.cfg texmf\tex\latex\ctex\config\ctexbackend.cfg texmf\tex\latex\ctex\fontset\ctex-fontset-macold.def texmf\tex\latex\ctex\fontset\ctex-fontset-fandol.def texmf\tex\latex\ctex\fontset\ctex-fontset-hanyi.def texmf\tex\latex\ctex\fontset\ctex-fontset-macnew.def texmf\tex\latex\ctex\fontset\ctex-fontset-adobe.def texmf\tex\latex\ctex\fontset\ctex-fontset-mac.def texmf\te